<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECHS LEVEL TIE WITH INDIA 2-2. [CORRECTED 23:35 GMT]</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECHS LEVEL TIE WITH INDIA 2-2. [CORRECTED 23:35 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>PRIBRAM, Czech Republic 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech</p>
<p>Republic pulled level with India in their Davis Cup tennis</p>
<p>World Group, first round tie after winning the first of the</p>
<p>reverse singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>(Corrects to make clear tie level)</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Petr Korda beat Leander Paes 5-7 6-3 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>Czech Republic tied with India 2-2.</p>
</text>
